  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ask age",
   "texto": [
    "**几岁** usually asks the age of a child; **多大** is used to ask more generally. **今年** means «this year» and **生日**, «birthday». The number + month + number + **号**: **十 月 三 号** = October 3 is used for the date."
